🎮 HOW TO PLAY PONG

• This is a 2-player Pong game.
• Prevent the ball from crossing your side.
• Each miss gives the opponent 1 point.

🎮 Controls:
Left Player:
W → Move Up
S → Move Down

Right Player:
↑ Arrow Key → Move Up
↓ Arrow Key → Move Down

❌ Quit Game:
Press Q to exit the game.

🏆 Objective:
Score points by making your opponent miss the ball!
